Let values be a list of 1, 2, 3, 4, and 5.
Let last be the last position of values.
Let size be last plus 1.
Let target be 2.
Let offset be target modulo size.
Let result be an empty list of whole numbers.
For every position from 0 to last.
Let source be position plus size minus offset.
If source is at least size, set source to source minus size.
Append item source of values to result.

For each value in result, print value.
